---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mini Golf Scorecard"
  description="A simple scorecard app for mini golf and golf by HSL Innovations. Coming soon."
>
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mini Golf Scorecard</p>
    <div class="page-app-icon">
      <img
        src="/icons/mini-golf-scorecard.png"
        alt="Mini Golf Scorecard app icon"
        class="app-icon"
      />
    </div>
    <h1>Keep score, not paper.</h1>
    <p>
      Mini Golf Scorecard is a simple, friendly way to keep score for mini golf
      and golf, right from your iPhone.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-card">
    <h2>About Mini Golf Scorecard</h2>
    <p>
      Mini Golf Scorecard replaces the pencil and paper card with a clean,
      easy-to-use scorecard. Track strokes for every hole, keep score for your
      whole group, and see who comes out on top, whether you're playing a round
      of mini golf with friends and family or heading out to the golf course.
    </p>

    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>Mini Golf Scorecard is currently in development and coming soon.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
